    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Modern & Well Maintained 2 Bedroomed Apartment situated in Dingle Town Centre. The apartment which is finished to a very high standard also has an impressive A2 Energy Rating. It is located on the Ground Floor and is conveniently located to all amenities in Dingle and the surrounding areas. It is equipped with a modern Aer to Water Heating System and has Triple Glazed PVC Windows & Doors. The accommodation comprises of a Kitchen/Dining Area, Living Room, 2 Bedroom (1Ensuite) and a Shower Room, a closet and Shower Room/Utility."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway\t4.31\tx\t1.19 +\r\n5.06\tx\t1.19\tWooden Floor; Velux Window\r\nKitchen/Living/Dining Room\t6.03\tx\t5.66\tWooden Floor; Fully Fitted Kitchen; Recessed Lighting\r\nBedroom 1\t5.60\tx\t4.44\tWooden Floor\r\nStorage Closet\t1.64\tx\t0.98\tWooden Floor\r\nShower Room/Utility\t3.89\tx\t2.31\tTiled Floor; WC, WHB, Shower. Unit\r\nBalcony\t4.36\tx\t1.62\tConcrete Floor"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "\tGround Floor Apartment\r\n\tConveniently located only a short stroll from the Town Centre\r\n\tAer to Water Heating System\r\n\tImpressive A2 Energy Rating\r\n\tFibre Broadband Available nearby\r\n\tTriple Glazed PVC Windows & Doors\r\n\tAccess via Electronic Security Gates\r\n\t1 Designated Car Parking Space Provided\r\n\tWell Maintained & in Excellent Condition"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: A2"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Continuing up Main Street onto Upper Main Street, the entrance to this Apartment Complex is directly across the road from Barr na Sráide Bar."
      }
